<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NCT Smart Assistant</title>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #050505; color: #e6e6e6; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 50px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
        h1 { color: #ccff00; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .chat-box { background: #111; border: 1px solid #333; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1); }
        
        textarea { 
            width: 100%; height: 100px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #444; 
            color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1rem; box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        button { 
            background: #ccff00; color: black; border: none; padding: 12px 30px; 
            font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 15px; 
        }
        button:hover { background: #b3e600; }

        .result-box { text-align: left; background: #1a1a1a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; margin-top: 30px; border-left: 3px solid #ccff00; line-height: 1.6; }
        .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>🤖 NCT AI Assistant</h1>
        <p>Tanya apa saja tentang NCT, lagu, atau minta rekomendasi!</p>

        <div class="chat-box">
            <form action="/ask" method="POST">
                <textarea name="question" placeholder="Contoh: Jelaskan konsep NCT Dream, atau Rekomendasi lagu galau NCT..." required><%= question || '' %></textarea>
                <br>
                <button type="submit">✨ TANYA AI</button>
            </form>

            <% if (answer) { %>
                <div class="result-box">
                    <strong>Jawaban AI:</strong><br><br>
                    <%- answer %> 
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Kembali ke Home</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>